      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A Song of degrees of David. If ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it had not been",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the LORD who was on our side, now may Israel say;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.124.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.124.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it had not been",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the LORD who was on our side, when men rose up against us:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.124.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.124.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then they had swallowed us up quick, when their wrath was kindled against us:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.124.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.124.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then the waters had overwhelmed us, the stream had gone over our soul:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.124.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.124.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then the proud waters had gone over our soul.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.124.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.124.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Blessed ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the LORD, who hath not given us ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "as",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a prey to their teeth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.124.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.124.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Our soul hath escaped as a bird out of the snare of the fowlers: the snare ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " broken, and we have escaped.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.124.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.124.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Our help ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in the name of the LORD, who made heaven and earth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
